## Live Deployment (Production)

When ready to go live:

1. Update `PAYPAL_MODE` from `sandbox` to `live`
2. Update `PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID` and `PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET` to live credentials
3. Update PayPal webhook to live endpoint
4. Test with real payment (small amount)
5. Verify payment arrives at your PayPal business account

